> Then a quick run north: you'll be back in Orgrimmar for the Camping 101 hand-ins anyway,
> so training Enchanting and Tailoring now gets their skills climbing toward 20 from the
> start, and Enchanting's 101 can be done on this same trip.
zone Durotar
q Sen'jin: turn in [Report to Sen'jin Village]
  done turnin [Report to Sen'jin Village]
q Take [Practical Prey], [Legging It] and [Forgotten Loa Idols]
  done accept [Practical Prey], [Legging It], [Forgotten Loa Idols]
q Take [A Solvent Spirit], [Minshina's Skull] and [Report to Orgnil]
  done accept [A Solvent Spirit], [Minshina's Skull], [Report to Orgnil]
o Take the optional [Zalazane] and [Bloodtalon Matriarch]
  done accept [Zalazane], [Bloodtalon Matriarch]
p Buy a Fishing Pole, train Apprentice Fishing from {Lau'Tiki}, and fish off the shore to 20
  detail Buy the pole from the fishing vendor in Sen'jin (skip the Shiny Baubles to save coin), then fish off the shore right there until 20.
  detail Skill-ups come per catch, not per zone, so Sen'jin is as good as anywhere for the first 25 points.
  done skill Fishing 20
