  done accept [Vanquish the Betrayers]
q Turn in [A Peon's Burden] to {Innkeeper Grosk}
  reward A Peon's Burden: food.
  done turnin [A Peon's Burden]
q Take [For Honor] from {Turroc} and [Carry Your Weight] from {Furl Scornbrow}
  done accept [For Honor], [Carry Your Weight]
q Take [This Fruit Could Bite Back] from {Cook Torka}
  done accept [This Fruit Could Bite Back]
q Take [Break a Few Eggs] from {Cook Torka}
  minlevel 6
  done accept [Break a Few Eggs]
p Do [The Great Outdoors] ({Brakk} @52.0,47.4) and [Camping 101: Cooking]
  detail {Cook Torka} teaches Cooking and the {Basic Campfire}.
  done turnin [The Great Outdoors], [Camping 101: Cooking]
p At {Brakk}, also pick up [Camping 101: Enchanting] and [Camping 101: Tailoring]
  detail So they're in your log for the Orgrimmar run.
  done accept [Camping 101: Enchanting], [Camping 101: Tailoring]
p Buy Flint and Tinder and a few Simple Wood
n No Horde quest gives a wand before the mid-teens, in Durotar or Tirisfal
  detail A detour to the Undead start won't find one. The first non-crafted options are a level 12 random drop (Blazing Wand) and the Gloom Wand from town weapon vendors at 16.
  detail Crafted wands are bind-on-equip, so a trade chat or auction house purchase works too.
zone Orgrimmar
p Run north to Orgrimmar and train Apprentice {Enchanting} and {Tailoring}
  detail A few minutes up the road from Razor Hill. No level requirement in the beta.
  done skill Enchanting 1
  done skill Tailoring 1
