  detail Including the 5s for the 6-slot bag if you haven't bought it yet.
  detail Shopping, all from vendors: 1 Copper Rod (about 1s), about 26 {Mote of Magic} (10c each, {Kithas}, The Drag) and 1 Simple Wood (about 40c).
  detail Short on coin? Keep the bag and the Motes, and skip the wand. Not buying Imp grimoires helps here too.
p Craft a {Runed Copper Rod} and keep it forever
  detail 1 Copper Rod, 1 Mote.
  done item Runed Copper Rod 1
p Craft one {Novice's Practice Wand} and equip it
