p Disenchant every green you don't wear (soft suggestion)
  detail One Strange Dust per {Enchant Chest – Inferior Stamina} carries Enchanting from 15 to about 70.
p Once you have spare dust, build the {Enchanted Lute}
  detail It takes Simple Wood and Strange Dust, and gives a camp armor buff.
