  detail Take [The Disruption Ends], [Supplies for the Crossroads], [Stolen Silver] (hold it) and
  detail [The Zhevra].
  done turnin [Disrupt the Attacks]
  done accept [The Disruption Ends], [Supplies for the Crossroads], [Stolen Silver], [The Zhevra]
q Northern Razormane camps: kill 8 Geomancers, 8 Defenders and Kreenig Snarlsnout
